<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 18,400 MT resulted from increases for China (29,000 MT, including changes of 28,000 MT from unknown destinations), Morocco (17,600 MT, all switched from unknown destinations), and Mexico (7,000 MT) being partially offset by reductions for unknown destinations (40,500 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 51,800 MT were mainly to China (28,000 MT), Morocco (17,600 MT), and Hong Kong (5,000 MT).</p>
</text>
